{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amelia expected her evening to be perfectly ordinary. What she did not expect was for her best friend to <strong>hack her car</strong> and bring her against her will to the <strong>Haven</strong>, the ancient castle her family used to holiday in when she was a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far for being a sentimental visit, this improbable return to the place of her childhood finds Amelia forced to take part in a game she knows nothing about: not the how, not the who, and certainly not the why... <strong>And this game just might uncover secrets her family would have rather left hidden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.poster.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.webm?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.mp4?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/5f5fb26076e9f5631cf563d63e69bc8d.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Haven is yours to roam freely</strong> and in any order you want. Search through its handcrafted rooms, find secret passages and open <strong>forbidden doors</strong>. Uncover the castle's history and that of Amelia's family on this larger-than-life, intricate playing board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your observation skills and a <strong>keen sense of curiosity</strong> will be the keys to truly know the Haven and uncover every last of its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/6758205821d6bdfa1d6852be05c787eb.poster.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/6758205821d6bdfa1d6852be05c787eb.webm?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/6758205821d6bdfa1d6852be05c787eb.mp4?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/58271fc83394588e5f56ab8bc4505b3b.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own strategies, organise your team, position your fighters wisely and anticipate enemy patterns in <strong>exciting tactical battles</strong> where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each enemy has a unique behaviour</strong>, and learning them is the key to mastering this unique battle system at the crossroad between puzzle games and RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat is not the end: explore other paths, gather your strength and establish new strategies with <strong>a myriad unique fighters and skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/27b251dda5878a48c2087b1663195505.poster.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/27b251dda5878a48c2087b1663195505.webm?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/27b251dda5878a48c2087b1663195505.mp4?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/ee2a0757a964d7adfd59fda5a7e267d1.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a piece of speculative fiction that <strong>questions technology, ethics, and the weight of unspoken family trauma</strong>. Investigate both the present and childhood memories to find out the truth between Amelia's kidnapping, and the true reasons behind the mysterious game she finds herself playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/c4c0038289789ea383b20680fd068f10.poster.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/c4c0038289789ea383b20680fd068f10.webm?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/c4c0038289789ea383b20680fd068f10.mp4?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/eab4f23353cb99f7b9eaee0f985b2965.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entirely <strong>hand-drawn</strong> world comes alive to a soundtrack that blends <strong>epic orchestra and synth music</strong>, creating a unique atmosphere where <strong>ancient history meets futuristic technology</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/38890759746cbed423d45f2c49e64de6.webp?t=1768995432\" width=591 height=11 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow</strong> Dissimilar now for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/38890759746cbed423d45f2c49e64de6.webp?t=1768995432\" width=591 height=11 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No proselytizing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/3fad1376a98679f01db9a13357ecbc0ba4f2759c.jpg"},{"name":"The Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/d2c5996583e2b12915814403417cb6613683ac28.jpg"},{"name":"What a feeling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/272d28331e87dd27fe3137bc9e9229562aa6db23.jpg"},{"name":"Dismantled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/479bf2d0512fff285144f1332cb9f9e0b72ec33f.jpg"},{"name":"Defender of Brittany","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/c98c5bbcc9034c6a738bf5dcc92295bc5e338bba.jpg"},{"name":"Interstellar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/c7d16500fb3040340142d1c4b5378c0ffe0064a4.jpg"},{"name":"Walk on fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/c2f9bfc36edda3af6d18a3866cb59141a256e34d.jpg"},{"name":"Regular patron","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/3e187f1d30f6ed6ec7c76a18d156073831f78bcc.jpg"},{"name":"One big happy family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/b4ee1d186beeeb8346ee71e0d87034a2f58b6a66.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta unlock 'em all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904360/026350932baf1967e9bd7846689fa66e9e9b65c8.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2904360?t=1768995432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768995432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/9a582f94cf2c0cc26ffd8f521376adbd05566439/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768995432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/9a582f94cf2c0cc26ffd8f521376adbd05566439/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768995432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2904480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amelia expected her evening to be perfectly ordinary. What she did not expect was for her best friend to <strong>hack her car</strong> and bring her against her will to the <strong>Haven</strong>, the ancient castle her family used to holiday in when she was a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far for being a sentimental visit, this improbable return to the place of her childhood finds Amelia forced to take part in a game she knows nothing about: not the how, not the who, and certainly not the why... <strong>And this game just might uncover secrets her family would have rather left hidden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.poster.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.webm?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.mp4?t=1768995432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/5f5fb26076e9f5631cf563d63e69bc8d.avif?t=1768995432\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Haven is yours to roam freely</strong> and in any order you want. Search through its handcrafted rooms, find secret passages and open <strong>forbidden doors</strong>. Uncover the castle's history and that of Amelia's family on this larger-than-life, intricate playing board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your observation skills and a <strong>keen sense of curiosity</strong> will be the keys to truly know the Haven and uncover every last of its secrets.</p><p cla